{
  "title": "Girls’ Last Tour",
  "description": "Civilization is dead, but not Chito and Yuuri. Time to hop aboard their beloved Kettenkrad motorbike and wander what’s left of the world! Sharing a can of soup or scouting for spare parts might not be the experience they were hoping for, but all in all, life isn’t too bad…\n\n*Source: Yen Press, Vol. 1*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Adventure, Chibi, Cosmic Horror, Cute Girls Doing Cute Things, Denpa, Drama, Environmental Degradation, Episodic, Exploration, Future, Inconclusive Ending, Mono no Aware, Philosophical, Primarily Female Cast, Psychological, Sci-Fi, Seinen, Sketchy, Slice of Life, Snowscape, Tanks, Urban, Adapted to Anime, Award Winning, Family Drama, Female Centric Plot, Female Lead, Female Protagonist, Friendship, Iyashikei, Loneliness, Lost Civilization, Melancholy, Non-GL with Two Female Leads, Orphans, Philosophical Moments, Philosophy, Post-Apocalyptic, Post-War, Reflections on Human Existence, Robots, Short Chapters, Survival, Travel",
